  subtitles:
  - line: "There it is. It\u2019s time to call the mutant here, then kill it."
    seconds: 6.294
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Humanity has already interfered too much with this place;
    seconds: 11.235
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "I can\u2019t let us do any more harm."
    seconds: 14.226
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: I just have to power on the central reactor, then release the safety switches
      to the sides.
    seconds: 20.493
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: And then, so long to my chances of getting home, but this planet will be
